WEBVTT

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
CrownWager compares model estimates
with sportsbook odds.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
An XGBoost NBA moneyline model estimates
home-win probabilities.

00:22.000 --> 00:29.000
Estimated EV and half-Kelly stakes use
Decimal arithmetic.

00:29.000 --> 00:37.000
Model predictions, odds comparisons,
and cross-book arbitrage calculations.

00:37.000 --> 00:44.000
65.2% ± 0.8% accuracy: five-fold
cross-validation over 15,115 NBA games.

00:44.000 --> 00:50.000
Model estimates feed odds comparisons
and stake-size calculations.

00:50.000 --> 00:56.000
Picks settle on final scores; the track record
is marked insufficient below 20 settled picks.

00:56.000 --> 01:01.440
Informational only.
No real-money wagering in the app.
